update content_bodies set title = '#あまみ#tabi 4K 10分ver', description = '奄美大島の魅力を余すところなく伝える『#あまみ #tabi』の完全版です。奄美大島は、豊かな自然と独特の文化が残る世界自然遺産推薦地域です。この動画では、奄美大島出身の女子二人が、離れて暮らしながら観光地や景勝地をレンタカーで巡り、奄美大島の魅力を再発見します。奄美大島への旅行前に参考にしていただき、訪れた際には、どこを切り抜いてもSNS映えする景色を『#あまみtabi』のハッシュタグを付けてシェアしましょう！' where id = 'C4r5dLX2hhZlYfoFhx9KN';
update content_bodies set title = '#Amami #tabi 4K 10-minute version', description = 'The complete version of ''#Amami #tabi'' showcases the charm of Amami Oshima, a region recommended for World Natural Heritage status, rich in nature and unique culture. The video features two women from Amami Oshima who, while living away, rediscover the island''s attractions by touring various sightseeing spots and scenic locations in a rental car. This video serves as a great reference for those planning to visit Amami Oshima. When you visit, be sure to capture the Instagram-worthy scenery and share your photos with the hashtag ''#Amami #tabi''!' where id = 'M1pGm7pXswTghZiWmFnAP';
update content_bodies set title = '#あまみ#tabi 4K 3分ver', description = '奄美大島の魅力を余すところなく伝える『#あまみ #tabi』のダイジェスト版です。世界自然遺産推薦地域である奄美大島は、豊かな自然と独特の文化が残る場所です。この動画では、奄美大島出身の女子二人が、離れて暮らしながら観光地や景勝地をレンタカーで巡り、奄美大島の魅力を再発見します。奄美大島への旅行前に参考にしていただき、訪れた際には、SNS映えする美しい景色の写真を『#あまみ#tabi』のハッシュタグを付けてシェアしましょう。' where id = 'Q0HRSy_IQr1WgSD3RWb9b';
update content_bodies set title = '#Amami #tabi 4K 3-minute version', description = 'The video ''#Amami #tabi'' showcases the rich natural beauty and unique culture of Amami Oshima, a region recommended for UNESCO World Heritage status. It features two women from Amami Oshima who, while living away from their home island, explore various tourist spots and scenic locations by rental car, rediscovering the island''s charm. This digest version serves as a great reference for those planning to visit Amami Oshima. Visitors are encouraged to share their beautiful photos of the island on social media using the hashtag ''#Amami #tabi'' to highlight the picturesque scenery.' where id = '0vigLYfQTWyICUHJkpzZE';
update content_bodies set title = '城主クリス・ペプラーさんが語る、福知山城の魅力', description = '2020年の大河ドラマ「麒麟がくる」の放送直前に、TV・ラジオパーソナリティのクリス・ペプラーさんが福知山城の魅力と明智光秀の知られざる側面を発信します。ペプラーさんは明智光秀の子孫とされ、2019年2月に福知山城の特別大使に就任しました。3月には就任記者会見のPVが公開され、今回の動画はその続編です。前回の動画では福知山市の発展に尽くす意気込みを語り、今回は自らのナレーションで福知山城の魅力を伝えています。福知山が盛り上がりを見せていることを嬉しく思い、視聴者に福知山城と福知山への興味を持ってもらいたいと願っています。この動画は「知られざる明智光秀プロジェクト」の一環で、明智光秀と福知山のつながりを全国に発信するものです。' where id = 'O8_ncMyse1HkersfgVLzM';
update content_bodies set title = 'The Charm of Fukuchiyama Castle as Described by Lord Chris Peppler', description = 'As the release of the 2020 Taiga drama ''Kirin ga Kuru'' approaches, Chris Peppler, a TV and radio personality and special ambassador for Fukuchiyama, shares the allure of Fukuchiyama Castle and the legacy of Akechi Mitsuhide. Peppler, believed to be a descendant of Mitsuhide, was appointed as the castle lord in February 2019. This promotional video follows the release of a press conference video in March, where he expressed his commitment to the city''s development. In this new video, Peppler narrates the story of Fukuchiyama Castle, highlighting the city''s growing vibrancy and encouraging viewers to take an interest in both the castle and the city itself. This project is part of the ''Unknown Akechi Mitsuhide Project,'' aimed at promoting the lesser-known aspects of Mitsuhide and his connection to Fukuchiyama.' where id = '4XUoHbxlricGjNa2Dl2-A';
update content_bodies set title = 'かのやばら園プロモーションビデオ（2020コロナに負けるなバージョン）', description = 'この動画は脇村映像によって制作され、鹿屋市役所ダンス部の制作協力を受けています。コロナ禍においても、かのやばら園の魅力を伝えることを目的としたプロモーションビデオです。' where id = 'ndzRsD4JxlneplvJFZ47u';
update content_bodies set title = 'Kanoya Rose Garden Promotion Video (2020 COVID-19 Resilience Version)', description = 'This video was produced by Wakimura Eizo, with production cooperation from the Kanoya City Hall Dance Club.' where id = 'mni-RvtOTlhGVw0pRV1B0';
update content_bodies set title = '絶景美景佐渡編', description = '今回のテーマは『佐渡の絶景美景』です。佐渡の魅力を存分に楽しんでいただける内容となっています。佐渡の観光情報は、公式サイト（https://www.visitsado.com）をご覧ください。また、旅行プランを立てる方は、こちら（https://www.visitsado.com/tabiiro/）を参考にしてください。現在佐渡を旅行中の方は、リアルタイム情報をこちら（https://www.visitsado.com/realtime/）で確認できます。' where id = 'Z87oG2wA_smk8yZDizwX7';
update content_bodies set title = 'Stunning Scenery of Sado', description = 'The theme of this edition is ''The Stunning Scenery of Sado.'' Enjoy the beauty and charm of Sado Island. For more information on tourism in Sado, visit: https://www.visitsado.com. If you are planning a trip to Sado, check out travel plans here: https://www.visitsado.com/tabiiro/. For those currently traveling in Sado, visit: https://www.visitsado.com/realtime/.' where id = 'LU_YJ9IH-HzPNtjXuwF_W';
update content_bodies set title = '佐渡の大自然・海編', description = '今回のテーマは『佐渡の大自然・海』です。佐渡の美しい海岸線や海洋環境を探索しながら、佐渡の魅力を存分に楽しんでください。' where id = 'lG1AJINRsIf1E0avnsyFu';
update content_bodies set title = 'Sado''s Great Nature - Sea Edition', description = 'The theme of this edition is ''Sado''s Great Nature - Sea''. Enjoy the charm of Sado as you explore its beautiful coastal landscapes and marine environment.' where id = 'ncelp2muYOpp2cj-Jxqpx';
update content_bodies set title = '世界遺産登録応援ソング＆ダンス「佐渡は世界の宝島」', description = '平成29年6月24日、北沢浮遊選考場跡で「佐渡汽船連動企画RYUTistと行く佐渡金銀山応援ツアー」の参加者と市民約300人が集まり、世界遺産登録を願って気持ちを一つにし、ダンスで応援しました。' where id = 'GRvSe5PGy_wHWKpTQxLQv';
update content_bodies set title = 'Support Song and Dance for World Heritage Registration: ''Sado is a Treasure Island of the World''', description = 'On June 24, 2017, approximately 300 participants from the ''Sado Kisen Linked Project: RYUTist''s Sado Gold and Silver Mine Support Tour'' and local citizens gathered at the Kitazawa Floating Selection Site. They united their feelings and supported the wish for World Heritage registration through dance.' where id = 'G-sBOKlYV52j0t1MuJbq1';
update content_bodies set title = '学ぼう！「佐渡島の金山」', description = '令和６年７月２７日に世界文化遺産に登録された「佐渡島の金山」の成り立ちや特長、魅力を紹介します。この情報は、小中学校の探究学習や修学旅行の事前学習に役立つ内容となっています。特に、佐渡金銀山ガイダンス施設「きらりうむ佐渡」や史跡「佐渡金山」のリンクも提供されており、訪問者がより深く理解できるように工夫されています。' where id = '3BpsCLAW2bXAULS3pwgYk';
update content_bodies set title = 'Learn About the Sado Island Gold Mine', description = 'On July 27, 2024, the Sado Island Gold Mine was registered as a UNESCO World Heritage Site. This resource introduces the history, characteristics, and attractions of the gold mine. It is highly recommended for use in inquiry-based learning for elementary and junior high school students, as well as for pre-trip studies for school excursions.' where id = 'jpigYRewqssrQhcNP4G0f';
update content_bodies set title = '佐渡観光PR動画　ネイチャー編', description = '令和6年7月27日に「佐渡島の金山」が世界文化遺産に登録されました。この機会にぜひ佐渡を訪れ、佐渡の多様な魅力を体験してください。本動画のテーマは『佐渡の自然』です。佐渡に関する観光情報は、こちらをご覧ください：https://www.visitsado.com' where id = 'rCD3uYrGtZo-UNe7XT8jK';
update content_bodies set title = 'Sado Island Tourism PR Video - Nature Edition', description = 'On July 27, 2024, the ''Sado Island Gold Mine'' was registered as a UNESCO World Heritage Site. We invite you to visit Sado and experience its various attractions. This video focuses on the theme of ''Nature of Sado.'' For more tourism information about Sado, please visit: https://www.visitsado.com' where id = '1TJtyGggmy4l7UzGP5RpE';
update content_bodies set title = '佐渡観光PR動画　グルメ編', description = '令和６年７月２７日に「佐渡島の金山」が世界文化遺産に登録されました。この機会に是非佐渡へお越しいただき、佐渡の様々な魅力をご堪能ください。本動画のテーマは『佐渡の食』です。佐渡の観光情報はこちら：https://www.visitsado.com' where id = 'fbzktcGBCVDDugZriT5nJ';
update content_bodies set title = 'Sado Island Tourism PR Video - Gourmet Edition', description = 'On July 27, 2024, the ''Sado Island Gold Mine'' was registered as a UNESCO World Heritage Site. This is a great opportunity to visit Sado and enjoy its various attractions. The theme of this video is ''Sado''s Cuisine.'' For more tourism information about Sado, please visit: https://www.visitsado.com' where id = 'D5tmrBlVgnKiFUsqgRirj';
update content_bodies set title = '佐渡観光PR動画　トリップ編', description = '令和6年7月27日に「佐渡島の金山」が世界文化遺産に登録されました。この機会にぜひ佐渡を訪れ、佐渡の多様な魅力を体験してください。本動画のテーマは『佐渡島内を巡る』です。佐渡に関する観光情報は、こちらのリンクをご覧ください：https://www.visitsado.com' where id = '4Gt3e6eiR6npYd4E8mwbK';
update content_bodies set title = 'Sado Island Tourism PR Video - Trip Edition', description = 'On July 27, 2024, the ''Sado Island Gold Mine'' was registered as a UNESCO World Heritage Site. We invite you to visit Sado and enjoy its various attractions. The theme of this video is ''Exploring Sado Island.'' For more tourism information about Sado, please visit: https://www.visitsado.com' where id = 'yWjl9RBRXoaCY2YqyD_X4';
update content_bodies set title = '佐渡観光PR動画　歴史編', description = '令和６年７月２７日に「佐渡島の金山」が世界文化遺産に登録されました。この機会にぜひ佐渡へお越しいただき、佐渡の様々な魅力をご堪能ください。本動画のテーマは『佐渡の歴史』です。観光情報は、こちらをご覧ください：https://www.visitsado.com。' where id = 'qGbxR56I8NGbf1W7HCX-1';
update content_bodies set title = 'Sado Island Tourism PR Video - History Edition', description = 'On July 27, 2024, the ''Sado Island Gold Mine'' was registered as a UNESCO World Heritage Site. We invite you to visit Sado and experience its various attractions. This video focuses on the theme of ''Sado''s History.'' For more tourism information, please visit: https://www.visitsado.com.' where id = 'ENAfkUTmJq0Sstw8bzzzR';
update content_bodies set title = '想い出のあまるべ号', description = 'この映像は、平成19年（2007年）3月24日から4月1日まで豊岡駅と浜坂駅の間で運行された「想い出のあまるべ号」を紹介しています。' where id = 'OM6cI_1Rg4VStjJhlRiiw';
update content_bodies set title = 'Memories of Amaru-be Train', description = 'This video showcases the ''Memories of Amaru-be Train'' which operated between Toyooka Station and Hamasaka Station from March 24 to April 1, 2007.' where id = 'HBpXHu7fu1xBu_zIO58M_';
update content_bodies set title = 'さようなら寝台特急「出雲号」', description = '寝台特急「出雲号」は昭和47年3月にデビューし、山陰地方と東京を山陰本線経由で結ぶ重要な交通手段として活躍してきました。2006年3月18日（土）朝7時25分、余部鉄橋を少し遅れて通過し、最後の旅に出発しました。多くのファンが見送り、別れを惜しみました。' where id = 'WZIzvLFiFpnyt_J_mSe-4';
update content_bodies set title = 'Farewell to the Sleeper Limited Express ''Izumo''', description = 'The sleeper limited express ''Izumo'' debuted in March 1972, connecting the San''in region to Tokyo via the San''in Main Line. It served as a vital transportation link for locals traveling to Tokyo. On March 18, 2006, at 7:25 AM, the train passed the Ayabe Bridge, slightly delayed, as it made its final journey. Many fans gathered to bid farewell as it departed.' where id = 'tIQGrzMLvyiPliBrr_3Sp';
update content_bodies set title = '５月の香美町', description = '５月も今日で終わりですね。新型コロナウイルス感染症の影響で外出自粛が多かったため、香美町に来られなかった皆さんに、香美町の風景を少しご紹介します。観光ポスターの撮影地から「香住海岸」「和池の大カツラ」「うへ山の棚田」「かえる島」をお楽しみください。鳥のさえずりや水の音、カエルの鳴き声、波の音など、香美町の自然の音を感じてください。' where id = 'S0_6RqkHzJJbh_fitpncB';
update content_bodies set title = 'Kōbichō in May', description = 'As May comes to an end, we reflect on the month that was largely spent in self-restraint due to the impact of COVID-19, preventing many from visiting Kōbichō. We would like to share a glimpse of the scenery in Kōbichō during May. Enjoy views from popular tourist spots such as ''Kasumi Coast,'' ''O-Katsura of Wajike,'' ''Uhe Mountain Terraced Rice Fields,'' and ''Kaeru Island.'' Immerse yourself in the natural sounds of Kōbichō, including birds chirping, water flowing, frogs croaking, and waves crashing.' where id = '2Y1qD1I6ZH-FrUXnzYf2x';
update content_bodies set title = '６月の香美町', description = '６月も今日で終わりですね。６月１０日に梅雨入りし、雨の降る日が多くなりました。町内の田植えも終わり、田んぼにとっては恵みの雨といったところでしょうか。また、香住海岸に夕日が沈む風景を見ることができる季節となりました。６月の香美町の風景を少しではありますが、ご紹介させていただきます。香美町観光ポスターの撮影地から「香住海岸」「和池の大カツラ」「うへ山の棚田」「かえる島」をご覧ください。夕日の景色、雨の音、鳥のさえずりなど、香美町のありのままの風景をお楽しみください。' where id = 'qwpxpa7tuT7zyJxL3Q0Oo';
update content_bodies set title = 'Kōbichō in June', description = 'June is coming to an end. The rainy season began on June 10, leading to many rainy days. The rice planting in the town has been completed, and the rain is a blessing for the rice fields. Additionally, it is now the season to witness the sunset over Kasumi Coast. This summary introduces some of the landscapes of Kōbichō in June, including the shooting locations for the town''s tourism posters: Kasumi Coast, the Great Katsura of Waki, the terraced rice fields of Uhe Mountain, and Kaeru Island. Enjoy the natural scenery of Kōbichō, including the sunset views, the sound of rain, and the chirping of birds.' where id = 'VA797O1CEqZWpEwdTq52G';
update content_bodies set title = '７月の香美町', description = '７月が終わりました。７月３１日に梅雨が明け、暑い夏がやってきます。熱中症には十分注意してください。ここでは、７月の香美町の風景を少し紹介します。香美町観光ポスターの撮影地である「香住海岸」「和池の大カツラ」「うへ山の棚田」「かえる島」をご覧いただけます。夕日の景色や漁火の明かり、ヒグラシの鳴き声、鳥のさえずりなど、香美町の自然の美しさをお楽しみください。' where id = 'lRAhDPo3P-rvhxOrTksfE';
update content_bodies set title = 'Kōbichō in July', description = 'July has come to an end. The rainy season finally ended on July 31, and the hot summer is approaching. Please take care to avoid heatstroke. Here, I would like to introduce a glimpse of Kōbichō''s scenery in July. You can see ''Kasumi Coast,'' ''Oikeno Ōkatsura,'' ''Uhe Mountain''s Terraced Rice Fields,'' and ''Kaeru Island,'' which are locations featured in Kōbichō''s tourism posters. Enjoy the natural beauty of Kōbichō, including sunset views, fishing lights, the sounds of evening cicadas, and the chirping of birds.' where id = '87jLpqIg4kpWyNzORP7jX';
update content_bodies set title = '８月の香美町', description = '８月が終わり、９月が始まる香美町では、底曳き網漁と香住ガニ漁が解禁となり、漁港が賑わいを見せています。この時期の香美町の風景を少し紹介します。観光ポスターの撮影地である「香住海岸」「和池の大カツラ」「うへ山の棚田」「かえる島」などが登場します。夏らしい青空、青い海、青々と育つ稲穂、セミの鳴き声など、香美町の自然の美しさを楽しむことができます。' where id = 'RPvRI2J1iA1Oiyxv7mGG7';
update content_bodies set title = 'Kōbichō in August', description = 'As August comes to an end and September begins, Kōbichō is bustling with activity as bottom trawling and Kasumi crab fishing have been lifted. This marks a lively season for the fishing ports. The description provides a glimpse of the landscapes of Kōbichō, showcasing locations such as ''Kasumi Coast,'' ''Wai Pond''s Great Katsura,'' ''Uhe Mountain''s Terraced Rice Fields,'' and ''Kaeru Island.'' Visitors can enjoy the vibrant summer scenery, characterized by a blue sky, blue sea, lush green rice paddies, and the sounds of cicadas, reflecting the true essence of Kōbichō.' where id = 'n3Bwl0DGKN7oiFZkWP2Y6';
update content_bodies set title = '９月の香美町', description = '９月が終わり、１０月が始まります。朝晩は涼しく、過ごしやすい日々が続いています。町内では稲刈りが始まり、実りの秋、食欲の秋を感じる季節となりました。香美町の美味しい食材をぜひ味わってください。９月の香美町の風景を少し紹介します。観光ポスターの撮影地である「香住海岸」「和池の大カツラ」「うへ山の棚田」「かえる島」などをお楽しみください。秋らしい青空、青い海、稲刈りの終わった田、鳥のさえずりなど、香美町の自然の風景を堪能してください。' where id = 'NYI7dHBj96mFmpaSHmRLV';
update content_bodies set title = 'Kōbichō in September', description = 'As September comes to an end and October begins, the weather has become cooler, making it more comfortable to spend time outdoors. The rice harvesting in the town has started, marking the arrival of autumn, a season of abundance and appetite. Visitors are encouraged to enjoy the delicious local ingredients of Kōbichō. The description includes a brief introduction to the scenic views of Kōbichō in September, featuring locations such as ''Kasumi Coast,'' ''Waiike''s Great Katsura,'' ''Uhe Mountain''s Terraced Rice Fields,'' and ''Kaeru Island.'' Enjoy the beautiful autumn sky, blue sea, harvested rice fields, and the sounds of birds in the natural landscape of Kōbichō.' where id = 'Vu4TGanM16S1eM2FWDQ_H';
update content_bodies set title = 'おもしろ自販機～自動販売機から梨ゴロリン～', description = '9月限定で販売される兵庫県香美町香住特産の二十世紀梨を自動販売機で購入できます。この季節以外にも驚きのラインナップが揃っており、年間を通じて楽しめます。設置場所は地図リンクを参照してください。また、この自販機はテレビでも紹介されています。' where id = 'jqe8_O95jQ_hWcfCKvJr2';
update content_bodies set title = 'Interesting Vending Machine - Buy Pears from a Vending Machine', description = 'Available only in September, this vending machine offers the special 20th Century Pear from Kasumi, Hyogo Prefecture. Besides this seasonal delight, the vending machine features an impressive lineup of products throughout the year. For the location, visit the provided map link. The vending machine has also been featured on television.' where id = 'kdPnmXaMmBE7erIT38NKN';
update content_bodies set title = '板仕野で棚田ボランティアをやってみよう！', description = '香美町村岡区の板仕野地域には、緩やかな地形を利用した棚田が広がり、ミネラル豊富な水や土壌、昼夜の寒暖差を活かして育てたお米は美味しいと評判です。一部ではブランド米「とろかわの恋」も栽培されています。人口減少の中、魅力ある棚田を守るため、農作業を手伝う「棚田ボランティア」を募集します。活動内容は動画で確認できます。棚田での農業に参加しませんか？お申し込みをお待ちしています。 

【お問い合わせ先】香美町農林水産課：0796-36-0846。申込受付は令和4年3月から予定しており、詳細は香美町ホームページに掲載します。 

【活動期間】4月中旬から10月中旬まで。詳細は農家と調整して決定します。 

【募集対象や参加費】棚田での農業や農家との交流に興味がある方はどなたでも無料で参加可能です。 

【交通手段】各自でお願いします。' where id = 'pcARIhG5mmcq7rvEj4QES';
update content_bodies set title = 'Try Volunteer Work in the Terraced Rice Fields of Itashino!', description = 'The Itashino area in Kamitown''s Muraoka district features terraced rice fields that utilize the gentle terrain. The rice grown here, nourished by mineral-rich water and soil, and the temperature differences between day and night, is renowned for its deliciousness, with some being branded as ''Torokawa no Koi.'' As the population declines, we aim to preserve these attractive rice fields and are seeking volunteers to assist with farming activities. Please watch the video for more details on the activities. Would you like to join us in farming in the terraced fields? We look forward to your application. 

Contact: Kamitown Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries Division: 0796-36-0846. 
Applications will start in March 2022, and details will be posted on the Kamitown website as they become available. 

Activity Period: From mid-April to mid-October, with specific dates to be coordinated with farmers. 

Eligibility and Participation Fee: Anyone interested in farming in the terraced fields or interacting with farmers can participate for free. 

Transportation: Participants are responsible for their own transportation.' where id = '_wqy-mMlTjXqP2_YdwNT6';
update content_bodies set title = '五感を満たす旅　香美町', description = '「五感を満たす旅　香美町」という観光PR動画は、2022年の第4回日本国際観光映像祭の日本部門オフィシャルセレクションに入選しました。この映像は、眺め、響き、香り、味、癒しの五感を通じて香美町の魅力を伝えています。90秒のフルバージョンでは、香住漁港や但馬牛の牛舎、米地味噌の加工場など、さまざまな撮影地が紹介されており、地域の文化や自然の美しさを体験できる内容となっています。各要素が強調され、視聴者は香美町の豊かな魅力を感じることができます。' where id = 'NcFUn0gZRxOfI5nFKyQ23';
update content_bodies set title = 'A Journey to Satisfy the Five Senses: Kami Town', description = 'This promotional video, titled ''A Journey to Satisfy the Five Senses: Kami Town,'' was selected for the official selection of the Japan section at the 4th Japan International Tourism Film Festival (2022). The video invites viewers to enjoy the beauty of Kami Town through the five senses: sight, sound, smell, taste, and healing. It features a 90-second full version showcasing various locations, including Kasumi Fishing Port, Tajima beef farms, rice miso processing facilities, and scenic spots like the coastline and temples. Each sensory element is highlighted, allowing viewers to experience the rich culture and natural beauty of the area.' where id = '6ar9-GFUf-sIVA24rOf5C';
update content_bodies set title = '五感を満たす旅　香美町', description = '「五感を満たす旅　香美町」をテーマにした観光PR動画を制作しました。眺（ながめ）、響（ひびき）、香（かおり）、味（あじ）、癒（いやし）の五つの要素を通じて、香美町の魅力を体感していただけます。この映像は、特に「眺」（ながめ）に焦点を当てた60秒の映像です。撮影地には、うへ山の棚田、長楽寺、香住海岸、大引の鼻、かえる島、ゆうなぎの丘、香住漁港、村岡集落の町並み、小代集落の町並み、余部橋梁が含まれています。地域の自然が彩る「味」や心に響く「響」、美しい大地の「香」、心穏やかな「癒」などを紹介する他の映像もあります。' where id = 'hCUGQX68OBVLFUCc_FfC-';
update content_bodies set title = 'A Journey to Satisfy the Five Senses: Kamitown', description = 'We have created a promotional video for tourism based on the concept of ''A Journey to Satisfy the Five Senses: Kamitown.'' Enjoy the beauty of Kamitown through the elements of view, sound, scent, taste, and healing. This particular video focuses on the visual aspect, showcasing stunning views in a 60-second format. The filming locations featured include Uhe Mountain''s terraced rice fields, Chōraku-ji Temple, Kasumi Coast, Ōbiki Nose, Kaeru Island, Yūnagi Hill, Kasumi Fishing Port, the townscape of Muraoka, the townscape of Odo, and the Ayabe Bridge. Additional videos highlight the natural flavors, resonating sounds, beautiful scents, and calming experiences of the region.' where id = 'w6hBtMKMJVnmIEo2n6UtT';
update content_bodies set title = '五感を満たす旅　香美町', description = '「五感を満たす旅　香美町」をテーマにした観光PR動画を制作しました。香美町の魅力を、眺（ながめ）、響（ひびき）、香（かおり）、味（あじ）、癒（いやし）の五つの要素で感じて楽しんでいただけます。この映像は「響」をテーマにした60秒のもので、撮影地には漁火と星空、吉滝、矢田川、香住漁港の競り、JR山陰本線を走る列車、香住海岸、岡見公園が含まれています。さらに、自然が彩る「味」、心に響く「眺」、地域を賑わす「響」、美しい大地の「香」、心穏やかな「癒」をテーマにした他の映像もご覧いただけます。' where id = '7Wdy0boGHgpjcSqAN3Jwy';
update content_bodies set title = 'A Journey to Satisfy the Five Senses: Kamitown', description = 'We have created a promotional video for tourism based on the concept of ''A Journey to Satisfy the Five Senses: Kamitown.'' Enjoy the beauty of Kamitown through its elements: view, sound, scent, taste, and healing. This video features the ''Sound'' aspect and lasts 60 seconds. The filming locations include the fishing fire and starry sky, Yoshitaki, Yatagawa, the auction at Kasumi Fishing Port, trains running on the San''in Main Line, Kasumi Coast, and Okami Park. Additional videos highlight the natural ''Taste,'' heartwarming ''View,'' community-invigorating ''Sound,'' beautiful earth''s ''Scent,'' and calming ''Healing.''' where id = 'vS1HJZ27XP-6uq7owUYnv';
update content_bodies set title = '五感を満たす旅　香美町～美しい大地の「香」', description = '「五感を満たす旅　香美町」をテーマにした観光PR動画が制作されました。眺め、響き、香り、味、癒しの五つの要素を通じて香美町を楽しむことができます。この映像は「香り」に焦点を当てた60秒の作品です。撮影地には香住海岸、しおかぜ香苑、香住漁港、岡見公園、矢田川、うへ山の棚田、村岡集落の町並み、和池の大カツラが含まれています。さらに、自然の「味」、心に響く「眺」、地域を賑わす「響」、美しい大地の「香」、心穏やかな「癒」についての追加動画も用意されています。' where id = 'se6PN7KmVOEoXeI115v3w';
update content_bodies set title = 'A Journey to Satisfy the Five Senses: Kamitown - The ''Fragrance'' of Beautiful Land', description = 'A promotional video has been created under the concept of ''A Journey to Satisfy the Five Senses: Kamitown''. Enjoy Kamitown through the elements of view, sound, fragrance, taste, and healing. This particular video focuses on the ''fragrance'' aspect and lasts 60 seconds. The filming locations featured in the video include Kasumi Coast, Shiokaze Kaen, Kasumi Fishing Port, Okami Park, Yatagawa, Uhe Mountain Terraced Rice Fields, the townscape of Muraoka, and the Great Katsura of Waiike. Additional videos highlight the natural ''taste'', resonating ''view'', vibrant ''sound'', beautiful ''fragrance'', and calming ''healing''.' where id = 'oliN_4-M-dMmWOUZSOU0S';
update content_bodies set title = '五感を満たす旅　香美町～心穏やかな「癒」', description = '「五感を満たす旅　香美町」をテーマにした観光PR動画を制作しました。眺め、響き、香り、味、癒しの五つの要素を通じて香美町の魅力を体感できます。この映像は「癒し」に焦点を当てた60秒の作品です。撮影地には吉滝、長楽寺、木の殿堂、矢田川温泉、大乗寺、香住海岸、香住漁港、しおかぜ香苑が含まれています。さらに、自然の「味」、心に響く「眺」、地域を賑わす「響」、美しい大地の「香」をテーマにした他の映像も用意されています。' where id = 'HcZRVu_AJPDrTE6SNu7IY';
update content_bodies set title = 'A Journey to Satisfy the Five Senses: Kamitown - A Place of Healing', description = 'We have created a promotional video for tourism based on the concept of ''A Journey to Satisfy the Five Senses: Kamitown.'' Enjoy the beauty of Kamitown through its elements: view, sound, scent, taste, and healing. This particular video focuses on the aspect of ''healing'' and has a duration of 60 seconds. The filming locations featured in this video include Yoshitaki, Chourakuji Temple, the Hall of Trees, Yatagawa Onsen, Daijouji Temple, Kasumi Coast, Kasumi Fishing Port, and Shiokaze Kouen. Additional videos highlight the natural ''taste,'' resonant ''view,'' vibrant ''sound,'' and beautiful ''scent'' of the region.' where id = 'pqyt9nIJxFKOWeXgEsgdY';
update content_bodies set title = '五感を満たす旅　香美町', description = '「五感を満たす旅　香美町」をテーマにした観光PR動画を制作しました。眺め、響き、香り、味、癒しの五つの要素を通じて香美町の魅力を体感できます。この30秒のCM映像では、それぞれの五感を表現しています。映像に登場する撮影地は、香住漁港、松葉ガニの選別、但馬牛の牛舎、村岡米、但馬牛のステーキ、松葉ガニ料理、香住海岸、しおかぜ香苑、吉滝、大乗寺、香住漁港の競り、日本海の波、ゆうなぎの丘、余部橋梁など多岐にわたります。さらに、各要素に関連する動画リンクも提供されています。' where id = 'ALiszYW89L6bmLd8wohvk';
update content_bodies set title = 'A Journey to Satisfy the Five Senses: Kamitown', description = 'We created a promotional video for tourism based on the concept of ''A Journey to Satisfy the Five Senses: Kamitown.'' Enjoy the beauty of Kamitown through the elements of sight, sound, smell, taste, and healing. This 30-second commercial showcases each of the five senses. The filming locations featured in the video include Kasumi Fishing Port, Matsuba crab sorting, Tajima beef farm, Murakami rice, Tajima beef steak, Matsuba crab dishes, Kasumi Coast, Shiokaze Kōen, Yoshidaki, Daijō-ji, Kasumi Fishing Port auction, waves of the Japan Sea, Yūnagi Hill, and Ayabe Bridge. Various links to the full version and shorter clips are provided for further exploration.' where id = '8ty4Va9DJ0sGFq1fmRxGy';
update content_bodies set title = 'MATSUNOYAMA DINING in Bijin-bayashi 2018', description = '雪国（Yukiguni）は8000年以上の歴史を持ち、雪によって形作られた独特の地域です。サンフランシスコやアテネと同じ緯度に位置する湯沢では、日本海の暖流の影響で、12月から4月にかけて驚異的な量の雪が降ります。このため、湿気が多く粘り気のある雪が形成され、特有の風景が生まれます。東京からわずか70分の距離にある雪国では、地域の歴史や文化、生活様式を反映した旅館を通じて、時を超えた体験が提供されます。各旅館はその環境の影響を受けた独自の表現であり、まるで良質なワインのようです。訪問者は、これらの旅館やその背後にいる人々の物語を学ぶことで、この素晴らしい地域への理解を深めることができます。' where id = 'ci_VR_lPDHuRCq6gwuDy-';
update content_bodies set title = 'MATSUNOYAMA DINING in Bijin-bayashi 2018', description = 'Yukiguni, with over 8000 years of history, is a unique region shaped by snow. Located at the same latitude as cities like San Francisco and Athens, Yuzawa experiences an extraordinary amount of snowfall from December to April due to warm currents in the Sea of Japan. This results in high moisture and sticky snow, creating a distinctive landscape. Just 70 minutes from Tokyo, Yukiguni offers a timeless experience through its ryokans, which reflect the area''s history, culture, and lifestyle. Each ryokan is a unique expression of the region, influenced by its environment, much like fine wine. Visitors can learn the stories behind these ryokans and the people who run them, deepening their appreciation for this remarkable area.' where id = 'pYMLcVQc87A8RAgkRw3EA';
update content_bodies set title = '飛騨高山 ふるさとの風景', description = '岐阜県高山市は、標高3,000メートル級の山々に囲まれた自然豊かなエリアです。春には新緑、夏には涼やかな高原の風、秋には色鮮やかな紅葉、冬には雪景色と、四季の移ろいを全身で感じられます。北アルプスの麓に広がる風景は、訪れるたびに異なる表情を見せ、心に深い感動を与えます。澄んだ空気や野鳥のさえずり、木々を渡る風の音が、日常の喧騒を忘れさせてくれます。春には枝垂れ桜、夏には清流、秋には黄金色の山々、冬には幻想的な雪景色が広がります。また、古い町並みや匠の技もこの地の魅力の一部です。自然と文化が寄り添う高山は、訪れる人の心を癒す特別な場所です。心を整える旅に、飛騨高山へ。' where id = 'tJnqEaQr4ev3wXSXCpsN1';
update content_bodies set title = 'Hida Takayama: A Landscape of Hometown', description = 'Takayama, located in Gifu Prefecture, is a nature-rich area surrounded by mountains over 3,000 meters high. Visitors can experience the changing seasons: fresh greenery in spring, cool breezes in summer, vibrant autumn leaves, and a winter wonderland covered in snow. The scenery at the foot of the Northern Alps transforms with each visit, leaving a lasting impression. The clear air, the chirping of birds, and the sound of wind through the trees create a soothing atmosphere that helps one forget daily hustle. In spring, cherry blossoms bloom, while summer offers refreshing streams and greenery. Autumn paints the mountains in gold and crimson, and winter presents a magical snowy landscape. Beyond nature, the old town and craftsmanship add to the area''s charm. Takayama, where nature and culture coexist, is a special place that gently heals the heart. A journey to Hida Takayama awaits you, offering tranquil moments in harmony with the seasons.' where id = 'VIIUsQf9x7Zo3FHM5RDGk';
update content_bodies set title = '五酒五感、#飛騨高山 で味わう極上の一杯', description = '岐阜県高山市は、北アルプスに囲まれた歴史的な町並みと自然の美しさで知られる観光地です。しかし、この町にはもう一つの魅力があります。それは「酒」です。高山市では、日本酒、クラフトビール、ウイスキー、ワイン、珍しいレモンリキュールの五種類のお酒が地元で造られています。このように多彩な「地酒」を一つの市で飲み比べできる場所は全国的にも珍しいです。江戸時代から続く酒蔵で作られる伝統的な日本酒や、地元の湧き水と麦芽を使ったクラフトビール、高地の気候を活かしたフルーティなワイン、果実から作る香り高いリキュール、こだわりの蒸留で仕上げたウイスキーなど、豊かな酒文化が息づいています。高山市では、お酒そのものだけでなく、その背景にある風土や技術、人々の想いも味わうことができます。' where id = 'ls2M6LctbvplpUbHXQnXF';
update content_bodies set title = 'Five Senses, One Exceptional Drink in Hida Takayama', description = 'Takayama, located in Gifu Prefecture, is a tourist destination known for its historical streets and abundant natural beauty, nestled among the Northern Alps. However, it also boasts another charm: its local alcoholic beverages. In Takayama, you can find a variety of drinks including sake, craft beer, whiskey, wine, and even unique lemon liqueur, all produced locally. This diversity of ''local sake'' available for tasting in one city is quite rare in Japan. Traditional sake brewed in long-standing breweries since the Edo period, craft beer made from local spring water and barley, fruity wines benefiting from the high altitude climate, aromatic liqueurs made from highland fruits, and distinctive whiskeys crafted with care all contribute to a rich drinking culture. In Takayama, you can savor not only the drinks themselves but also the culture, techniques, and passion behind them.' where id = 'Skz4pz-vtzOgI95vyeDMi';
update content_bodies set title = '飛騨高山　花めぐり', description = '岐阜県高山市は、四季を通じて美しい花々が咲き誇る自然豊かな場所です。春には淡いピンクの桜が町並みを包み、夏には可憐な梅花藻が清流に揺れ、秋には紅葉とともに山野草が色を添えます。雪解けのころ咲く福寿草は、黄金色の輝きで一足早い春の訪れを告げてくれます。高山の豊かな自然が織りなす、花と風景の美しい調和を楽しみながら、ゆったりと散策してみませんか？' where id = 'V54X6t7b11vhTUrTdCpT7';
update content_bodies set title = 'Hida Takayama Flower Tour', description = 'Takayama, located in Gifu Prefecture, is a nature-rich area where beautiful flowers bloom throughout the year. In spring, delicate pink cherry blossoms envelop the town, while in summer, the charming Umehanamizu sways in the clear streams. Autumn brings vibrant colors with foliage and wildflowers. The Fukujusō, which blooms around the time of snowmelt, heralds the arrival of spring with its golden glow. Experience the beautiful harmony of flowers and landscapes created by Takayama''s rich nature. Why not take a leisurely stroll and enjoy the changing expressions of flowers in each season?' where id = 'HO6QFZWPzEKKog1_mDiw6';
update content_bodies set title = '飛騨高山　FarmersGifts megumi', description = '岐阜県高山市は、日本の美しい自然が広がる魅力的な地域です。山々に囲まれ、清らかな水と肥沃な土地に恵まれ、四季折々の豊かな恵みをもたらします。寒暖差のある環境で育つ野菜や果物は、栄養価が高く、甘みや美味しさが詰まっており、食感も抜群です。自然との調和を大切にした農法が採用され、安心して口にできる食材が揃っています。直売所や市場で旬の食材を直接購入でき、地元ならではの味を楽しむことができます。大自然の息吹を感じながら、地元の豊かな味覚を堪能できる高山は、健康志向の方にもおすすめのエリアです。四季折々の風景とともに、心も体も満たされるひとときをお過ごしください。' where id = 'HY17yzWcR6A4YkLVz1Phx';
update content_bodies set title = 'Hida Takayama FarmersGifts Megumi', description = 'Hida Takayama, located in Gifu Prefecture, is a captivating region rich in Japan''s beautiful nature. Surrounded by mountains and blessed with pure water and fertile land, it offers abundant seasonal produce. The vegetables and fruits grown in this area, characterized by significant temperature differences, are highly nutritious, sweet, and delicious, with excellent textures. The farming methods prioritize harmony with nature, ensuring safe and reliable food sources. Visitors can purchase seasonal ingredients directly from local markets and enjoy unique local flavors. Takayama is an ideal destination for health-conscious individuals, allowing them to savor the rich tastes of the region while experiencing the breath of nature. Enjoy a fulfilling time for both body and mind amidst the seasonal landscapes.' where id = 'TcexTckccicvPCPIzNpy9';
update content_bodies set title = '飛騨高山 SPLASHアクティビティ', description = '岐阜県高山市は、山々に囲まれた美しい自然が広がるエリアです。暑い夏の日にぴったりの涼しげなアクティビティが豊富に揃っており、シャワークライミングや沢登り、川遊び、魚つかみなど、子供から大人まで楽しめる体験が人気です。これらのアクティビティを通じて、自然と一体となりながらリフレッシュできる機会を提供しています。日常では味わえないワクワク感を五感で体験してみてはいかがでしょうか。' where id = 'Hq5v1CutF965sV-iYBwNm';
update content_bodies set title = 'Hida Takayama SPLASH Activity', description = 'Hida Takayama, located in Gifu Prefecture, is surrounded by mountains and boasts beautiful natural scenery. It offers a variety of refreshing activities perfect for hot summer days. Visitors can enjoy experiences such as shower climbing, river trekking, playing in the river, and catching fish, making it a popular destination for both children and adults. These activities allow participants to immerse themselves in nature and rejuvenate. Why not take this opportunity to experience the excitement of nature with all your senses, something you can''t find in everyday life?' where id = 'kFtgJ9WwR9aPusivUwdHm';
update content_bodies set title = '飛騨高山 さくら映える町 朝日町', description = '御嶽山と乗鞍岳を望む朝日町は、鈴蘭高原からの大パノラマが特に美しい場所です。ここは「枝垂れ桜の郷」として知られ、春には群生する福寿草や美女高原の水芭蕉など、特徴的な草花が春の訪れを感じさせてくれます。' where id = '6lY2mn5rAQxGhkgVFZq3J';
update content_bodies set title = 'The Town of Hida Takayama with Blooming Cherry Blossoms in Asahi Town', description = 'Asahi Town offers breathtaking views of Mount Ontake and Mount Norikura. The panoramic scenery from Suzuran Plateau is exceptional. Known as a cherry blossom hotspot, particularly for its weeping cherry trees, the area also features clusters of Fukujusō and water irises at Bijin Plateau, enhancing the spring atmosphere.' where id = 'kv97gURKlGfc1FJVtc1fe';
update content_bodies set title = '熊本県美里町ショートフィルム「恋スル 美里」　本編', description = 'このプロモーション動画は、熊本県美里町を舞台にしたラブコメディ短編映画です。自然が大好きな女の子「みさと」は、都会から来た男の子「広大」と不思議な出会いを果たします。映画には、オープニングテーマ「風の彼方」（作曲：菅野大地）とエンディングテーマ「恋スル美里」（作詞・作曲：MICA）など、特別に作られたオリジナル音楽が使用されています。予告編や風景映像、ダンス編もYouTubeで視聴可能です。また、美里町への移住に関する情報も提供されています。' where id = '8YOUIAJx90P2hD4LVoilw';
update content_bodies set title = 'Kumamoto Misato Town Short Film ''Koi Suru Misato'' Full Version', description = 'This promotional video showcases Misato Town in Kumamoto Prefecture. The story follows a girl named Misato, who loves nature and has grown up in Misato, as she encounters a boy named Koudai from the city in a mysterious way. This short film is a romantic comedy set in Misato Town. Please enjoy watching it. The film features original music composed specifically for it, including the opening theme ''Kaze no Kanata'' by Daichi Kanno and the ending theme ''Koi Suru Misato'' by MICA. Trailers and additional footage can be found on YouTube, along with information about relocating to Misato Town.' where id = 'Gb7W5-rm_a0KgUVHeGEdJ';
update content_bodies set title = '秘境と神話が眠る町　#丹生川', description = '北アルプスの南端に位置する丹生川町は、乗鞍岳に抱かれ、ライチョウが生息する自然豊かな地域です。五色が原には原生林が広がり、秘境の森が守られています。丹生川町ではトマトやホウレンソウの生産が盛んで、北アルプスの水で育った野菜は滋味に溢れています。また、サイクリストにも人気のスポットで、農山村の風景と乗鞍岳の絶景が魅力を放ち、ペダルをこぐ力を与えます。四季折々の美しい風景は懐かしさを感じさせ、未来に残したい宝物です。' where id = 'g1LRtB7U6xWyrNW32WAnS';
update content_bodies set title = 'A Town Where Hidden Realms and Myths Sleep - Niu River', description = 'Nestled at the southern end of the Northern Alps, Niu River Town is embraced by Mount Norikura, home to the rare Japanese rock ptarmigan. The area offers easy access to the mountainous world, with the Goshikigahara region featuring pristine forests that protect its hidden wilderness. Niu River Town is known for its abundant production of tomatoes and spinach, with vegetables nourished by the pure waters from the Northern Alps, bursting with flavor. It is also a popular destination for cyclists, who are captivated by the picturesque rural landscapes and breathtaking views of Mount Norikura, providing them with the energy to pedal on. The changing seasons in this rural landscape evoke a sense of nostalgia, making it a treasure worth preserving for the future.' where id = 'qwxyvk4rpjS69rh2U8KQp';
update content_bodies set title = '城下町の面影薫る歴史と文化を凝縮した町', description = '高山市街地は、城下町としての面影が色濃く残り、江戸時代の風情が漂う古い町並みが魅力です。ここには、国内で唯一現存する徳川幕府の遺構である高山陣屋や、日下部民芸館など、歴史を重ねた建物が数多く存在します。また、城下町を築き、高山城を拠点に藩政を行った武将・金森長近ゆかりの地を巡ることもでき、歴史的な趣を感じることができます。' where id = 'RZY1Fl2sEmyL4lVaJxLcz';
update content_bodies set title = 'A Town Rich in History and Culture Reflecting the Castle Town', description = 'Takayama, a city that retains the strong characteristics of a castle town, showcases the charm of the Edo period through its historic streets. The city is home to numerous buildings that have withstood the test of time, including the Takayama Jinya, the only remaining structure from the Tokugawa shogunate in Japan, and the Kusakabe Folk Museum. Visitors can also explore the area associated with the warlord Kanamori Nagachika, who established the castle town and governed the region from Takayama Castle, adding a layer of historical significance to the experience.' where id = 'lrIj-gSY5RVL1eoSYRhxK';
update content_bodies set title = '飛騨高山 新伝統工芸：iPhone ケース制作', description = '飛騨高山に息づく匠の技は、木や漆、土石を生活に活かす技術として受け継がれ、現代のライフスタイルに合わせた新しい形の「新伝統工芸」として進化しています。特に注目されるのは、飛騨春慶や一位一刀彫を取り入れた「ノクターレ」のスマートフォンケースです。天然木を使用し、スマートフォンの形状にぴったりとフィットするデザインが特徴で、ノクターレの木工技術と一位一刀彫の匠の技が融合しています。使い込むほどに美しさが増すこのケースは、新伝統工芸を日常生活に取り入れる素晴らしい方法です。' where id = 'HyKNJbx2bACfD_0-9MYxB';
update content_bodies set title = 'Hida Takayama New Traditional Craft: iPhone Case Production', description = 'The craftsmanship of Hida Takayama continues to thrive, with skills passed down through generations, utilizing wood, lacquer, and stone in daily life. This tradition has evolved into ''New Traditional Crafts,'' which adapt to modern lifestyles while preserving the essence of traditional techniques. One notable product is the ''Nocturne'' smartphone case, which combines the artistry of Hida Shunkei and Ichii Ittobori with contemporary design. Made from natural wood, the case features a design that complements the smartphone''s shape, showcasing the meticulous woodworking skills of Nocturne and the precision of Ichii Ittobori. As the case ages, its beauty and character deepen, making it a perfect way to incorporate new traditional crafts into everyday life.' where id = '6dKUSAIf-wZ5FXinNBp24';
update content_bodies set title = '飛騨高山 秋の高山祭（八幡祭）', description = '秋の高山祭（八幡祭）は、櫻山八幡宮の例祭で、毎年10月9日・10日に開催されます。この祭りは春の高山祭（山王祭）と合わせて高山祭と呼ばれ、日本三大美祭の一つとして知られています。高山の人々によって大切に守られてきたこの祭りでは、11台の豪華な祭屋台が曳き揃えられ、伝統衣装を身にまとった数百名の行列が、お囃子や雅楽、獅子舞に先導されて祭地域を巡ります。夜になると、各屋台には約100個の提灯が灯され、夜の闇を華やかに彩ります。高山祭は、飛騨人の誇りを象徴する祭りです。' where id = '4ubhHYTvtfyeUw-iiXD8C';
update content_bodies set title = 'Takayama Autumn Festival (Hachiman Festival)', description = 'The Takayama Autumn Festival, also known as the Hachiman Festival, is held annually on October 9th and 10th at Sakurayama Hachiman Shrine. The Takayama Festival refers to both the autumn and spring festivals, with the spring festival (Sanno Festival) taking place on April 14th and 15th at Hie Shrine. Recognized as one of Japan''s three great beautiful festivals, it has been cherished and preserved by the people of Takayama. During the autumn festival, 11 ornate festival floats, known as ''Mikoshi Yatai,'' are paraded, showcasing their splendid designs. Hundreds of participants dressed in traditional costumes, including those in ''kamishimo'' attire, march through the festival area, accompanied by music, gagaku, and lion dances. At night, each float is illuminated by around 100 lanterns, creating a vibrant display against the darkness. The Takayama Festival embodies the pride of the Hida people.' where id = 'pb9-AS6dJW1jzHMCR4p2z';
update content_bodies set title = '飛騨高山 秋の高山祭 2022年10月9日、10日', description = '秋の高山祭（八幡祭）は、櫻山八幡宮の例祭として毎年10月9日と10日に開催されます。2022年は残念ながら雨天の影響で御神幸や宵祭が中止となりましたが、からくり奉納は無事に行われました。この祭りは豪華な屋台や精巧な動きが魅力のからくり人形で知られ、高山の豊かな文化遺産を体現しています。高山祭の見どころをぜひご覧ください。' where id = 'pWaf4XL7Q6LHBCtP9unN8';
update content_bodies set title = 'Hida Takayama Autumn Festival - Takayama Matsuri on October 9th and 10th, 2022', description = 'The Autumn Takayama Festival, also known as the Hachiman Festival, is an annual event held on October 9th and 10th at Sakurayama Hachiman Shrine. In 2022, the festival faced unfortunate rainy weather, leading to the cancellation of the procession and evening festivities. However, the traditional karakuri puppet performances were successfully held. The festival is renowned for its splendid floats and intricately moving puppets, showcasing the rich cultural heritage of Takayama. We invite you to experience the highlights of the Takayama Festival.' where id = 'i_d35N2LVOh09mkn5f8VI';
update content_bodies set title = '天下の名城 高山城 ⑤本丸', description = '天生14年（1586年）、飛騨国主となった金森長近公が築城した高山城の姿を、現在の町並みから探ります。案内人は、飛騨地域の歴史研究や発掘調査に長年携わり、高山市史編纂専門員を務めた田中彰さんです。高山城は、古い町並みや遺構とともに、地域の歴史を物語る重要な存在です。' where id = 'iWTMxKVn2aaYQTEeSDmXu';
update content_bodies set title = 'Takayama Castle: The Main Keep', description = 'In 1586, Kanamori Nagachika became the lord of Hida Province and constructed Takayama Castle. This exploration looks at the castle''s presence in the current townscape. The guide, Akira Tanaka, has been involved in historical research and excavation in the Hida region for many years and serves as a specialist in compiling the history of Takayama City.' where id = 'qH82LuyMH1Wd0BAegdm3a';
update content_bodies set title = '天下の名城 高山城 ④からめ手～中段屋形、東北曲輪', description = '天生14年（1586年）に飛騨国主となった金森長近公が築城した高山城の姿を、現在の町並みから探ります。案内人は、飛騨地域の歴史研究や発掘調査に長年携わり、高山市史編纂専門員を務めた田中彰さんです。高山城は、古い町並みや遺構とともに、地域の歴史を物語る重要な文化遺産です。' where id = 'VnbjzDh3orSRfSLPEYMmY';
update content_bodies set title = 'The Famous Castle Takayama: The Side Entrance - Middle Layer Building and Northeast Enclosure', description = 'In 1586, Kanamori Nagachika became the lord of Hida Province and constructed Takayama Castle. This exploration looks at the castle''s features from the perspective of the current townscape. The guide is Akira Tanaka, who has been involved in historical research and excavation in the Hida region for many years and serves as a specialist in compiling the history of Takayama City.' where id = '6zHmTr-YiL6zN3R685-nt';
update content_bodies set title = '天下の名城 高山城 ②三之丸', description = '天生14年（1586年）、飛騨国主となった金森長近公が築城した高山城の姿を、現在の町並みから探ります。案内人は、飛騨地域の歴史研究や発掘調査に長年携わり、高山市史編纂専門員を務めた田中彰さんです。高山城は、古い町並みや遺構とともに、山城としての魅力を持っています。' where id = 'x_Rn2mEAAY5mGiUIq8HMV';
update content_bodies set title = 'The Famous Castle Takayama: Part 2 - San-no-Maru', description = 'In 1586, Kanamori Nagachika became the lord of Hida Province and constructed Takayama Castle. This exploration looks at the castle''s presence in the current townscape. The guide is Akira Tanaka, who has been involved in historical research and excavation in the Hida region for many years and serves as a specialist in compiling the history of Takayama City.' where id = 'mtb5ZDgwYyOctnQvBRRPH';
update content_bodies set title = 'この旅 多彩 濃色 飛騨高山 観光ムービー', description = '日本一面積が広い市である高山市は、町のすみずみまでたくさんの見どころに溢れています。城下町の雰囲気が色濃く残る古い町並みや、歴史や文化、知られざる逸話、日常では味わえない体験など、多彩な魅力が満載です。旅を、思い出を、もっと色濃く、鮮やかにするために、私たちの町、飛騨高山へようこそ。' where id = 'YjAYcdsV7H4B0UmBWTah9';
update content_bodies set title = 'Diverse and Colorful Travel in Takayama, Hida', description = 'Takayama, the largest city in Japan by area, is filled with numerous attractions throughout the town. The old streets retain a strong castle town atmosphere, showcasing a rich history and culture, along with lesser-known anecdotes and unique experiences that cannot be found in daily life. This journey aims to make your memories more vivid and colorful. Welcome to our town, Takayama in Hida.' where id = 'bQPelXbvNJgWnOTM_LH1M';
update content_bodies set title = '飛騨高山の紅葉', description = '飛騨高山は、北アルプスに代表される雄大な自然に囲まれています。日本で一番広い市である高山市では、標高差に応じて毎年10月下旬ごろから紅葉が始まります。この記事では、飛騨高山の紅葉スポットを紹介します。' where id = 'JYAlyCxSphs_4FjKgscfj';
update content_bodies set title = 'Autumn Foliage in Hida Takayama', description = 'Hida Takayama is surrounded by the majestic nature of the Hida Mountains (Northern Alps). Takayama City, the largest city in Japan by area, experiences the onset of autumn foliage around late October each year, in accordance with its elevation differences. This text introduces various spots for enjoying the autumn colors in Hida Takayama.' where id = 'PyKwGxU1jL-e5FwizUy8l';
update content_bodies set title = '飛騨高山 手筒花火打ち上げ', description = '飛騨高山の夏の風物詩である「飛騨高山手筒花火打ち上げ」は、毎年8月9日に開催されます。宮川の川床に設けられた仮設台で、飛騨高山手筒組のメンバーが竹筒に仕込んだ花火を手に持ち、火の粉を浴びながら打ち上げを行います。打ち上げの終わりには轟音が響き、豪快に噴き上がる火柱が迫力を増します。このイベントは、打ち上げる者と観る者の厄払いを願って行われており、毎年多くの人々が訪れます。' where id = 'OcpEb4eMBYniaScO5QNZk';
update content_bodies set title = 'Hida Takayama Handheld Fireworks', description = 'The Hida Takayama Handheld Fireworks event is a summer tradition held annually on August 9th. A temporary platform is set up along the Miyagawa River, where members of the Hida Takayama Handheld Fireworks group hold bamboo tubes filled with fireworks. As they launch the fireworks, they are showered with sparks, creating a thrilling spectacle. The event culminates in a loud explosion and towering flames, providing an exhilarating experience for both participants and spectators. This event is held to wish for the purification of both those who launch and those who watch the fireworks.' where id = '4J1GcEGakPuUZe3BgjrMK';
update content_bodies set title = '飛騨高山の滝', description = '飛騨高山は、北アルプスに囲まれた自然豊かな町で、江戸時代の面影を残す古い町並みや高山祭など、歴史と伝統文化が息づいています。日本一面積が広い高山市には、迫力満点の平湯大滝をはじめ、岐阜県名水50選に選ばれた滝や日本の自然100選にも選ばれた滝が点在しています。訪れる人々は、四十八滝、大倉滝、三ツ滝、銚子の滝、イノシシ滝、岩船の滝など、さまざまな滝を楽しむことができ、トレッキングやハイキング、絶景を楽しむのに最適な場所です。' where id = 'AVvG_qYi-PVWX1YSvS-OB';
update content_bodies set title = 'Waterfalls in Hida Takayama', description = 'Hida Takayama, surrounded by the majestic Hida Mountains (Northern Alps), is a town rich in history and traditional culture, retaining the charm of the Edo period. As the largest city in Japan by area, Takayama offers stunning waterfalls, including the impressive Hirayu Otaki. The region is also recognized as one of Gifu Prefecture''s 50 selected sources of fine water and is listed among Japan''s top 100 natural sites. Visitors can explore various waterfalls such as Shihoyotaki, Okura Falls, Mitsutaki, Choshi Falls, Inoshishi Falls, and Iwafune Falls, making it a perfect destination for trekking, hiking, and enjoying breathtaking outdoor scenery.' where id = 'R_Va_a9eIUWtoTPF46KpG';
update content_bodies set title = '飛騨高山へようこそ', description = '日本一面積が広い市である高山市は、町のすみずみまでたくさんの見どころに溢れています。自然の恵みあふれる食文化や伝統工芸、文化、祭りなど、飛騨高山ならではの体験ができる場所です。高山祭や古い町並み、飛騨牛など、訪れる人々にとって魅力的な要素が揃っています。' where id = 'Jkibbjmy6hXKgPGvLmWDz';
update content_bodies set title = 'Welcome to Takayama', description = 'Takayama, the largest city in Japan by area, is filled with numerous attractions throughout the town. Visitors can experience the rich food culture, traditional crafts, festivals, and other unique experiences that can only be found in Hida Takayama.' where id = '0XnF9LePGYBxnFf8kUIKI';
update content_bodies set title = '飛騨高山 7蔵のん兵衛まつりの楽しみかた', description = '飛騨高山・7蔵のん兵衛まつりは、緊急事態宣言解除に伴い、3月5日（金）から3月28日（日）までの期間で開催されます。新型コロナウイルス感染症対策として、アルコール消毒や検温などの実施が行われるため、皆様のご協力をお願いいたします。' where id = 'QSmtStq-Hepx1lFJH4LSQ';
update content_bodies set title = 'How to Enjoy the Hida Takayama 7-Kura Nonbei Festival', description = 'The Hida Takayama 7-Kura Nonbei Festival will be held from March 5 (Friday) to March 28 (Sunday) following the lifting of the state of emergency. The event will implement measures to prevent the spread of COVID-19, and we ask for everyone''s cooperation with alcohol disinfection and temperature checks.' where id = 'CQqLCRFBNXCKBBC6v57zu';
update content_bodies set title = '第4回日本国際観光映像祭受賞　JWTFF受賞　飛騨高山の酒蔵 コンセプトムービー ver.1', description = 'このコンセプトムービーは、飛騨高山にあるいくつかの酒蔵を紹介しています。具体的には、平瀬酒造店、二木酒造、舩坂酒造店、原田酒造場、川尻酒造場、平田酒造場、老田酒造店が取り上げられています。映画は、地域の酒造りの豊かな伝統と技術を強調し、これらの酒蔵の文化的な重要性を伝えています。また、飛騨高山の7蔵のん兵衛まつりの公式ウェブサイトでは、イベントや参加酒蔵に関する詳細情報が提供されています。' where id = 'mJwZ1unV2ESXWbWKFh93t';
update content_bodies set title = '4th Japan International Tourism Film Festival Award - JWTFF Award - Hida Takayama Sake Brewery Concept Movie ver.1', description = 'The concept movie highlights several sake breweries in Hida Takayama, including Hirase Sake Brewery, Futaki Sake Brewery, Funasaka Sake Brewery, Harada Sake Brewery, Kawajiri Sake Brewery, Hirata Sake Brewery, and Oita Sake Brewery. The film showcases the rich tradition and craftsmanship of sake production in this region, emphasizing the cultural significance of these breweries. The official website for the Hida Takayama 7 Kura Nonbei Festival provides more information about the event and the participating breweries.' where id = 'ux5k52LTqeGZujoPMGV5D';
update content_bodies set title = '飛騨高山の酒蔵 コンセプトムービー ver.2', description = 'このコンセプトムービーでは、飛騨高山の酒蔵である平瀬酒造店、二木酒造、舩坂酒造店、原田酒造場、川尻酒造場、平田酒造場、老田酒造店が紹介されています。各酒蔵の独自の特徴や職人技が強調されており、地域の酒造りの豊かな伝統が表現されています。詳細については、公式の飛騨高山 7蔵のん兵衛まつりのウェブサイトをご覧ください。' where id = 'fx8X4xbqW_-YXt1DKT5sg';
update content_bodies set title = 'Hida Takayama Sake Brewery Concept Movie ver.2', description = 'This concept movie features several sake breweries in Hida Takayama, including Hirase Shuzoten, Futaki Shuzou, Funasaka Shuzouten, Harada Shuzoujo, Kawajiri Shuzoujo, Hirata Shuzoujo, and Oita Shuzouten. The film showcases the unique characteristics and craftsmanship of these breweries, highlighting the rich tradition of sake production in the region. For more information, visit the official Hida Takayama 7 Kura Nonbei Festival website.' where id = 'Bz1zLMKJ8sh4QSzt95QBq';
update content_bodies set title = '【ＪＲ北上線　Ｔｈｅローカルな旅】 ほっとゆだ駅→ゆだ錦秋湖駅のナレーション付き車窓動画（上り方面）', description = 'この動画は、ゆだ高原駅から北上駅までの上り区間を紹介しています。車窓からの美しい風景や沿線の観光情報を、岩手めんこいテレビのアナウンサー高橋礼子さんがナレーションでお届けします。ローカル線ならではの魅力を感じながら、旅の雰囲気を楽しんでください。' where id = 's11rHF4TpMbTquQe_NnPv';
update content_bodies set title = 'The Local Journey on JR Kitakami Line: Narrated Video from Hotto Yuda Station to Yuda Kinkō Lake Station (Upward Direction)', description = 'This video features the upward section from Yuda Kōgen Station to Kitakami Station, showcasing the scenic views and tourist information along the route. The narration is provided by Reiko Takahashi, an announcer from Iwate Menkoi Television, who hails from Nishiwaga Town. Experience the unique charm of this local train line.' where id = 'BW3fXl5SuySxJD5aGcI_D';
